# The shared libfuri + libapp entry table (the "furi" library; spec R2b.9,
# R5.2, 7b, J.3; tools/mkshlibc.py, ld/shfuri.ld, <minix/shlibc.h>).
#
# One function per line; the line number (from 0, comments and blank lines
# not counted) is its slot in the table at the start of the library in
# flash (SHFURI_BASE).  FROZEN: never reorder, insert or remove a name
# while GZ_ABI stays 2 - a program built today calls slot n forever.  New
# functions go at the END.
#
# Only what the apps call is exported (and only what that reaches is in
# the library, --gc-sections): a ported app that needs another libfuri or
# libapp function appends it here.  localtime and mktime are the static
# libc members libapp needs anyway: exported, so the apps share that copy.
#
# Started 2026-11-17 (issue #201) with the functions furihello, remind,
# alarm, timed and alert call, sorted by name.  (Their variables, app_cats
# and tune_names, have no slot: they are PROVIDEd at their places.)
app_alert
app_arm
app_cat
app_id_ok
app_log
app_save
